1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 16]

34
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:49,040
Yun Qi still dares hold Blood Banquets.
He won't get away this time.

35
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:57,140
[Blood Banquet]

36
00:02:04,410 --> 00:02:06,650
- Go.
- Go.

37
00:02:07,130 --> 00:02:08,190
- Move.
- Move.

38
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:08,750
Yes.

39
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:21,250
Your father opposed the marriage
at first.

40
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:23,160
I pleaded with him until he agreed.

41
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:24,230
Take it.

42
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,110
Thank you, Mother Consort.

43
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,120
You've done so much for me.

44
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:34,180
I'm truly grateful.

45
00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:39,900
[Yun Shao is granted to Crown Prince
as a junior consort]

46
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:43,800
Why a junior consort?

47
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:45,080
Why not Crown Princess?

48
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,710
The Yun family has a Noble Consort.

49
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:49,000
If it gains a Crown Princess,

50
00:02:49,710 --> 00:02:51,630
the realm will condemn the Yuns.

51
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,910
You don't want

52
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:55,910
Yun Shao blamed for that, do you?

53
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,870
If I can't even make

54
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,400
the woman I love my wife,

55
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:02,710
I don't deserve to marry.

56
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,120
Please ask Father

57
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,000
to issue a new Imperial Edict

58
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:09,040
making Yun Shao Crown Princess.

59
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:10,360
Enough.

60
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,870
I've given in enough.

61
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:13,910
Be satisfied.

62
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,560
Learn from Pei Zhao.

63
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,310
I arranged his marriage,

64
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,190
and he agreed without complaint.

65
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,310
He never makes demands.

66
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:23,800
Noble Consort.

67
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,280
He's a subject.

68
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,150
I'm the Crown Prince.

69
00:03:26,350 --> 00:03:27,740
Don't compare him to me.

70
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,560
But he's more obedient,

71
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:30,650
more rational,

72
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:31,750
and more clearheaded.

73
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,150
You praise Pei Zhao so much

74
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,240
and always defend him.

75
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:42,090
Could the palace rumors be true?

76
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,910
Do you have feelings for him?

77
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:44,960
How dare you?

78
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,630
Don't forget, Noble Consort.

79
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,870
I am the future Emperor.

80
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:49,680
You don't decide

81
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,910
whom I marry.

82
00:03:57,290 --> 00:03:59,430
So now I decide nothing?

83
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,240
What a good son you are.

84
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:10,360
Wrong again.

85
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,360
I have a real mother.

86
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:16,040
You're Father's consort

87
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:17,680
and my foster mother.

88
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:26,390
Foster mother?

89
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,530
Your Highness.

90
00:04:28,770 --> 00:04:29,590
Your Highness.

91
00:04:29,930 --> 00:04:30,700
Your Highness.

92
00:04:31,150 --> 00:04:31,860
Your Highness.

93
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:32,900
Your Highness.

94
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:33,950
Bad news.

95
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:34,840
Yun Qi

96
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,140
was arrested by the Fengyi Bureau.

97
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,870
Useless fool.

98
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,320
Let him die.

99
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,510
Your Highness.

100
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:45,010
He's my only son.

101
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,070
He's still useful to you.

102
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,020
I beg you.

103
00:04:47,030 --> 00:04:48,580
Please save him.

104
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,040
Enough.

105
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:54,240
I'm here.

106
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,610
Pei Zhao won't kill him.

107
00:04:58,430 --> 00:04:59,310
Where is he?

108
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,430
In the Fengyi Bureau prison.

109
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:06,290
You scoundrels.

110
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,070
I'm commander
of the Blood Jade Mine Garrison,

111
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:09,910
son of the Minister,

112
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,570
and the Noble Consort's nephew.

113
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,150
Release me at once.

114
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,560
And I may spare your lives.

115
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:15,250
Guards!

116
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,430
Ji Chang'an, bring Pei Zhao here.

117
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,480
Lord Pei will not see you.

118
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,000
He ordered Guard Ji and me

119
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,040
to question you.

120
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,510
Yun Shao?

121
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:30,680
Let me out.

122
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:32,710
You're not getting out.

123
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:37,060
I'm your brother. How dare you?

124
00:05:37,370 --> 00:05:38,200
You're dead.

125
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,600
You'd better confess.

126
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:44,100
Who's behind the Blood Banquets?

127
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,720
Shao.

128
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:48,270
I'm your brother.

129
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,070
Have you forgotten

130
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:51,310
our childhood game?

131
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,190
I'll never forget

132
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:56,600
you stabbed me with the hairpins,

133
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:59,560
or how you cut out Yun Xiang's tongue

134
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,830
and slit her throat.

135
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,190
Father made me do it.

136
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:04,430
I didn't want to.

137
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,270
Yun Xiang failed

138
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:07,950
to serve you well.

139
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,390
She deserved to die.

140
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,240
Shao.

141
00:06:10,650 --> 00:06:12,070
Let me out.

142
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:14,270
I'll treat you well once I'm out.

143
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,630
You're cruel,

144
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,070
heartless,

145
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,240
and treat lives like nothing.

146
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,720
You're a rabid beast.

147
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:25,240
So you want the hard way?

148
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:28,190
I'm Qingluan nobility.

149
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:30,390
Touching me is a capital crime.

150
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,560
None of you will get away.

151
00:06:31,570 --> 00:06:32,450
This is the Fengyi Bureau.

152
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,500
Listen well.

153
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:35,070
Break the law,

154
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,390
and whether you're nobility or royalty,

155
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,180
you pay for it.

156
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,390
Fine.

157
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:50,430
Don't release me now.

158
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,680
Later, even if you beg on your knees,

159
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,510
I won't leave.

160
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,290
You scoundrels.

161
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:05,320
Yun Qi openly held Blood Banquets,

162
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,900
drank human blood,

163
00:07:10,010 --> 00:07:11,150
and took lives.

164
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:13,040
I Have left it

165
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:17,690
to the Fengyi Bureau.

166
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:21,700
You should stay out of it.

167
00:07:22,590 --> 00:07:25,220
Your Majesty, they were Wingless.

168
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:27,870
For Qi to even notice
such worthless lives

169
00:07:27,870 --> 00:07:29,360
was their blessing.

170
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:31,630
They were still human lives!

171
00:07:34,450 --> 00:07:35,940
Get out.

172
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,630
Without my permission,

173
00:07:39,990 --> 00:07:41,680
you are not to set foot

174
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:45,290
in the Imperial Study again.

175
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:49,450
Your Majesty, please calm down.

176
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,980
My apologies.

177
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,710
I'll take my leave.

178
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,160
Whose portrait is His Majesty viewing?

179
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:08,810
The younger Lady Yun's.

180
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,910
Yun Shao?

181
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,610
Yes.

182
00:09:12,590 --> 00:09:14,670
Why view Yun Shao's portrait?

183
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:18,000
Notify Prince of Xin'an.

184
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:20,720
Have him prepare
a second Blood Jade Ritual

185
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,850
and put Qingyan on the throne.

186
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,340
Your Highness.

187
00:09:24,650 --> 00:09:25,750
Bad news.

188
00:09:27,250 --> 00:09:28,320
General Yun is dead.

189
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:40,820
Qi.

190
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,300
My boy.

191
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,550
Qi.

192
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:44,860
Qi, wake up.

193
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:45,950
My boy.

194
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:47,700
What happened?

195
00:09:48,130 --> 00:09:49,000
My boy.

196
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,540
Sir.

197
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,840
He kept cursing,

198
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:52,650
then suddenly his chest burst open.

199
00:09:52,950 --> 00:09:54,340
Just like those at Mingyu Headquarters.

200
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,080
When I get out,

201
00:09:58,100 --> 00:10:00,040
I'll skin that girl alive.

202
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:20,580
You killed my son.

203
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:22,550
I'll make you pay with your life!

204
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:24,480
I'll have your life for this!

205
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,670
Yun Qi deserved his death.

206
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:27,000
No one else is to blame.

207
00:10:27,090 --> 00:10:28,760
You're the one who should die.

208
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:30,630
If you hadn't escaped that day,

209
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:32,220
my son wouldn't be dead?

210
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:34,530
Yet I lived.

211
00:10:43,350 --> 00:10:44,480
Yun Shao.

212
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:46,360
You framed him.

213
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,600
You'll pay for my brother's life.

214
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:51,020
I wish I'd killed him myself.

215
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,280
Too bad.

216
00:10:53,010 --> 00:10:54,770
Your master abandoned him.

217
00:10:56,930 --> 00:10:58,660
If you hadn't framed him,

218
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:01,330
how would he have died in prison?

219
00:11:01,730 --> 00:11:03,150
He murdered innocent girls.

220
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,140
He deserved punishment.

221
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:07,480
What innocent girls?

222
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:10,260
They were only Wingless.

223
00:11:12,490 --> 00:11:16,280
You plotted to kill your own brother.

224
00:11:16,510 --> 00:11:17,960
You're the one who deserves death.

225
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,030
He was your brother.

226
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:19,820
Not mine.

227
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:22,080
And I'm a Fengyi Guard.

228
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:22,960
He was a killer.

229
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:24,910
Arresting him

230
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:26,960
was my duty.

231
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:36,670
So you've been acting all along.

232
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,150
You pretended to be frail

233
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:42,550
and helpless,

234
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,320
but you're ruthless,

235
00:11:45,330 --> 00:11:46,570
coldhearted,

236
00:11:47,710 --> 00:11:50,150
and quick to draw a blade.

237
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:58,910
I'll avenge my brother.

238
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:04,000
And I'll make you pay in blood.

239
00:12:04,210 --> 00:12:05,260
You will rue this day.

240
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:07,410
Fine.

241
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:09,340
I'll be waiting.

242
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:13,840
Master.

243
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:16,660
One thing still puzzles me.

244
00:12:18,270 --> 00:12:18,720
Speak.

245
00:12:19,730 --> 00:12:21,660
Why did you have me
implant Gu in Yun Qi?

246
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,600
He's Yun's only son.

247
00:12:24,090 --> 00:12:25,980
How can we face the Noble Consort?

248
00:12:26,530 --> 00:12:28,720
Does Yun's son matter more

249
00:12:29,170 --> 00:12:30,480
than the Crown Prince?

250
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:36,660
Am I supposed to keep saving
that useless fool?

251
00:12:38,330 --> 00:12:39,140
Wise as always, Master.

252
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:41,980
Ah...

253
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,040
I've fought for Yong

254
00:12:46,190 --> 00:12:47,740
for 20 years.

255
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,440
I don't know

256
00:12:51,170 --> 00:12:54,600
how much blood and sweat I've shed,

257
00:12:55,570 --> 00:12:57,030
or how many times I nearly died.

258
00:12:58,870 --> 00:13:00,600
Yet those fools in the capital

259
00:13:01,610 --> 00:13:04,310
enjoy everything I fought for.

260
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,080
Yong should've changed

261
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,160
long ago.

262
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,500
Unto death, I follow you.

263
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:16,360
I'll give my life

264
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,410
for you.

265
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,010
Good.

266
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,030
Take it.

267
00:13:38,260 --> 00:13:40,140
[Fengyi Bureau]

268
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:41,740
Just like those at Mingyu Headquarters,

269
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,480
they had taken Gu pills beforehand.

270
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:51,530
Sir.

271
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,090
The Emperor suddenly fell gravely ill.

272
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,000
The Noble Consort summoned the ministers

273
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,870
and announced His Majesty's order.

274
00:13:58,500 --> 00:13:59,470
The Crown Prince will oversee the realm.

275
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,110
Something's wrong.

276
00:14:11,090 --> 00:14:11,570
Move.

277
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:12,740
- Sir.
- Sir.

278
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:23,320
Pei Zhao, receive the decree.

279
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:35,540
His Majesty says,
"Pei Zhao killed innocents

280
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,040
and betrayed my trust.

281
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:39,980
He is removed
as commander of the Fengyi Bureau.

282
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:43,010
Hand over the commander's gold seal
and the blood-jade ruler.

283
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,340
You will receive twenty lashes.

284
00:14:44,750 --> 00:14:47,140
Return home, reflect on your actions,

285
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,540
and mend your ways.

286
00:14:48,550 --> 00:14:50,140
We shall see how you behave."

287
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:04,370
Lord Pei, are you defying the throne?

288
00:15:06,590 --> 00:15:07,780
Your Highness, announce me.

289
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:09,460
I need to see His Majesty.

290
00:15:11,420 --> 00:15:12,030
See?

291
00:15:12,850 --> 00:15:15,530
He'll never serve you.

292
00:15:16,250 --> 00:15:16,950
Keep him alive,

293
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:19,320
and he'll only ruin Qingyan's plans.

294
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:21,900
Can't you give him a quick death?

295
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:23,810
Don't make him suffer.

296
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,780
Your Highness, you are mistaken.

297
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:31,350
If we want control of the Fengyi Bureau,

298
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:33,260
we need to make an example of him.

299
00:15:37,580 --> 00:15:38,080
Step back!

300
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:39,670
Execute

301
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,240
anyone who resists.

302
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:09,250
Sir, don't worry about us.

303
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:33,860
Your Highness.

304
00:16:57,630 --> 00:16:58,590
Sir!

305
00:16:58,810 --> 00:17:00,590
Guards, stop the Crown Prince.

306
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:01,570
Don't move.

307
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:03,680
Han Jin.

308
00:17:04,610 --> 00:17:06,070
So they're all your men.

309
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:10,640
They're the Crown Prince's men.

310
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:13,950
If he wants to rule them,

311
00:17:14,390 --> 00:17:15,790
they must fear him

312
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:19,640
and never dare say no.

313
00:17:30,230 --> 00:17:30,810
Chang'an.

314
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,420
Let them go.

315
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:55,630
Pei Zhao.

316
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:58,040
How dare you?

317
00:18:27,740 --> 00:18:30,550
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

318
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:35,360
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

319
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,420
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

320
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:43,360
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

321
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,190
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

322
00:18:49,410 --> 00:18:54,420
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

323
00:18:54,740 --> 00:19:02,770
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

324
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:11,660
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

325
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:20,330
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

326
00:19:20,710 --> 00:19:29,580
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

327
00:19:30,010 --> 00:19:38,500
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
